<title>ISRAEL: At least 70 die in Israeli copter crash - radio.</title>
<headline>At least 70 die in Israeli copter crash - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 70 people were killed in the mid-air crash of two army helicopters during a storm in northern Israel on Tuesday night, Israel Radio said.</p>
<p>&quot;At least 70 people were killed, said northern commander Major-General Amiram Levine in a briefing to reporters in the north,&quot; the radio reported. Earlier the radio had said 54 people were killed.</p>
</text>
